# A word that reaches the end of a row that wrapped goes on at the start of
# the next row, whichever half the pointer is on, and its copy has no line
# end at the wrap. A row that ended with a line feed ends the word.
# spec: ADR-1003, the selection; INTERFACE-vtium.md, The selection and copy
# covers: clipboard.selection
size 8 3
send "ab wrapping\r\nword"
select word at 5,0
copy
select word at 1,1
copy
select word at 1,2
copy
dump frame
